{"mode":"test","title":"","instruction":{"english":"","german":""},"readingText":{"instruction":{"german":"<p>Read the text. Then go to Exercise.<\/p>","english":""},"content":"<p>Let\u2019s think about one day in our lives. Are we happy <em>all the time<\/em>? No, we aren\u2019t! We feel happy, sad or tired at different moments of the day. And that\u2019s OK!<\/p><p>We all do different things to manage our feelings. Here\u2019s what four young people do.<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><custom-image id=\"custom-image_1\"><\/custom-image><\/p><p><b>Maya<\/b>\u21a0I\u2019m tired after school. So at home, I relax a bit in the living room. Then I do my homework.<\/p><p><b>Alex<\/b>\u21a0I\u2019m nervous before an exam! So, before the test I say, \u2018I can do this!\u2019 three times. That\u2019s good for me.<\/p><p><b>Dan<\/b>\u21a0When I\u2019m bored, I read. I read comics. They\u2019re my favourite!<\/p><p><b>Katie<\/b>\u21a0When I\u2019m angry, I go to my bedroom and open the window. I look at the trees and the birds in the garden. That helps!<\/p>","showOnStart":true,"configs":[{"id":"custom-image_1","type":"custom-image","url":"","name":"reading.png","width":-1,"margin":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0},"float":"none","style":""}],"tableConfig":{"mode":"percent","valueArray":["8","92"]}},"sequences":[{"instruction":{"german":"<p><b>Who says it? Read and choose <\/b><span style=\"background-color: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">ALEX, DAN, KATIE or MAYA<\/span><\/p>","english":""},"configs":[{"question":"<p>This comic is great! I\u2019m not bored now.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>DAN<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>ALEX<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>DAN<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>KATIE<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_0","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_01_CH_05\/unit_01_reading_01_ch_05\/"},{"question":"<p>Mum, I\u2019m in the living room! I\u2019m tired.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>ALEX<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>DAN<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>KATIE<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_1","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_01_CH_05\/unit_01_reading_01_ch_05\/"},{"question":"<p>I\u2019m not in the living room. I\u2019m angry.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>KATIE<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>ALEX<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>DAN<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>KATIE<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_2","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_01_CH_05\/unit_01_reading_01_ch_05\/"},{"question":"<p>I can do the test! I\u2019m not nervous now.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>ALEX<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>ALEX<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>DAN<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>KATIE<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_3","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_01_CH_05\/unit_01_reading_01_ch_05\/"},{"question":"<p>Look at the trees and the birds!&nbsp;I\u2019m not angry now.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>KATIE<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>ALEX<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>DAN<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>KATIE<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_4","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_01_CH_05\/unit_01_reading_01_ch_05\/"},{"question":"<p>I\u2019m not tired now! It\u2019s time to do my homework.<\/p>","correctAnswer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>","additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"<p>ALEX<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>DAN<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>KATIE<\/p>"},{"answer":"<p>MAYA<\/p>"}],"orientation":"vertical","id":"quiz_5","type":"quiz","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_01_CH_05\/unit_01_reading_01_ch_05\/"}],"staticConfigs":[],"parts":["<p><quiz id=\"quiz_0\"><\/quiz><\/p><p><quiz id=\"quiz_1\"><\/quiz><\/p><p><quiz id=\"quiz_2\"><\/quiz><\/p><p><quiz id=\"quiz_3\"><\/quiz><\/p><p><quiz id=\"quiz_4\"><\/quiz><\/p><p><quiz id=\"quiz_5\"><\/quiz><\/p>"],"globalTypesConfigs":[{"type":"quiz","orientation":"horizontal","itemPosition":"left","shuffle":false,"widthMode":"string","width":-1}]}]}